Retain file-orphaned audio DMA mappings until a matched successful SPF CLOSE_ALL
response proves remote quiescence. Keep live file ownership, legacy exports and
failed-close mapping pins; serialize address translation/send with reclamation.
A successfully quiesced retiring provider releases its own maps before deletion.

